{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026wg6bIaEDab1794977852.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>法國多個城市再有示威，近15萬人參與。其中巴黎約有2.8萬人參與，示威者包括勞工及學生等，要求加薪及增加教育資源。</p><p></p><p>法國內政部統計，當日全國約有共14.6萬人上街，工會方面則聲稱多於50萬人上街，其中巴黎約有17.5萬人，規模較月初高峰時有所回落。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.FRA.PROTEST-1200_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20266pVwxfxovy1794977883.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>示威浪潮自九月起，從巴黎蔓延至全國，持續近兩個月。十月中曾爆發大規模暴力衝突，有人趁機縱火及搶掠，許多店舖遭洗劫或破壞。有被砸毀櫥窗的商家指，由於看不到示威盡頭，不打算馬上修好櫥窗。為了減少損失，每周五會提早打烊，將高價商品收起，周末遊行期間更會關門。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T10:44:11.013531+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":251,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T04:43:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T13:02:12.297063+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T10:37:19.635838+00:00","content_hash":"48b9bfd5fb82c200ecc3daba5c92ae0e78c4255037e41afa8f29803d638bed7c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-18T10:44:11.013531+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}